NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE

These apps do not diagnose, treat or monitor any condition. Readings taken by
an optical ring are estimates, and blood pressure especially is inferred from
the pulse waveform rather than measured. Treat every value as a trend and
never as the basis for a medical decision.

The ring does not implement HRV, ECG, temperature, respiratory rate, stress or
blood sugar. Those capability bits read zero on this hardware whatever the
listing claimed.

NO AFFILIATION

Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or derived from any source belonging to the
ring's vendor or their SmartHealth app (com.zhuoting.healthyucheng). The
protocol documented in PROTOCOL.md and COMMANDS.md was recovered by observing
Bluetooth traffic to and from hardware that was bought and owned, and by
replaying frames against that same hardware. No vendor code was decompiled
into this project and none is redistributed here.

R99 rings ship under several names and firmware revisions. Nothing here is
guaranteed to hold on another ring; re-capture before relying on it.
